MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e70547d8134d5943ac3fafcae79c9dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: RelicDeal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EventData
  title: Mysterious meeting
  description: 'A word got out that two criminal factions are having a secret deal
    in a city tavern which includes an ancient dagger with some mystic properties.
    This dagger could be worth a lot. Zavren knows one of the factions known as Raven''s
    Grasp", as they are his former allies. He believes that getting a hold of this
    knife might be a moderately simple task... '
  image: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  choices:
  - choiceText: Ignore the deal
    outcomeText: Sometimes the reward is just not worth the risk. It's better to
      prepare for the task at hand.
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: Try to take the relic by force
    outcomeText: Zavren's intel may have been correct when it came to his former
      organization, but it seems that the other party doesn't take too kind to such
      unexpected surprises. Alas, your party managed to take the relic by force,
      albeit with a few bruises and scratches. (+700 gold, -30% HP)
    goldChange: 700
    hpChangePercent: 30
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: Try to take the relic stealthly
    outcomeText: Abdul's skills come in handy when it comes to these kinds of jobs.
      After careful observation he found an opening and incapacitated a member of
      the "Raven's Grasp" and took his clothes. With the help of Zavren and their
      criminal background they knew what to expect and how to act the part. In the
      end they used the organizations coin to which they had to add a bit and got
      the dagger without raising the suspicion. (+500 gold)
    goldChange: 500
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
